{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25471","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 海石楠 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 海石楠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔见历阳山，鸡笼已孤秀。\n今看海峤树，翠盖何幽茂。\n霰雪讵能侵，烟岚自相揉。\n攀条独临憩，况值清阴昼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}